\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30002310 (OWR-12341-001). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Representations of Lie Groups and Supergroups (2013), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2013/13, pp. 735--799. Primary report accessed 2026-10-11; relevant PDF pages 16, 17.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2013/13}.
\item[S3] Goldin 2008 (catalogue-listed context; not independently consulted in this preparation).
\url{https://doi.org/10.1134/S1063778808050177}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30002310}

