\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Computes decomposition-dependent evolution of the maximally mixed qubit and its conditional no-signaling failure for a specified nonlinear extension rule.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
