Coordinator checked the opposite-state Bloch derivatives and ensemble-dependent reduced evolution under the explicitly specified conditional-state rule. This additional check was model-assisted, not independent human verification.

\paragraph{Tools, process and contributions.}
Python 3 was used for file preparation and structural checks; no numerical experiment or theorem prover was used. Contribution prompt A was followed by prompt B. GPT-6 Astra with ultra reasoning drafted the research and performed its stated self-audit; any additional coordinator contribution is identified in the verification and audit. A GPT-6-based Codex coordinator assembled the manuscript and checked repository integration; its exact variant and reasoning configuration were not exposed. No human mathematical contribution, independent human proof check or formal proof certification is supplied. Complete derivations and the consulted source references are included here; private reasoning transcripts are not published.

\paragraph{Final status and first remaining gap.}
\textbf{UNRESOLVED}. A consistent composite-state rule and the source general flow/geometric/measure constructions remain missing.

